{"unit_id":"XiaoOu2024__dsh-root-planner-preset#feature-1","repo":"XiaoOu2024/dsh-root-planner-preset","commit":"0ea2ff01526c16010c9c694e2e365106f8ffe5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Root Planner 的功能「根代理规划与委派」：根代理先确定目标、约束和任务顺序，再把适合的研究、编辑或命令工作交给子代理。角色与委派规则由预设人设提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:12-21","persona.txt:48-50"]}
{"unit_id":"XiaoOu2024__dsh-root-planner-preset#feature-2","repo":"XiaoOu2024/dsh-root-planner-preset","commit":"0ea2ff01526c16010c9c694e2e365106f8ffe5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Root Planner 的功能「递归工作代理」：根代理和工作代理都可按人设规则委派任务，工作代理预设会递归用于后续层级，代理树深度由 Host 的子代理深度设置控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:12-14","persona.txt:12-14"]}
{"unit_id":"XiaoOu2024__dsh-root-planner-preset#feature-3","repo":"XiaoOu2024/dsh-root-planner-preset","commit":"0ea2ff01526c16010c9c694e2e36510626f8ffe5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Root Planner 的功能「任务边界与结果整合」：委派时说明允许修改的文件和命令，工作者完成后返回结论与变更摘要，由根代理检查并决定如何整合。","source":"generated","evidence":["persona.txt:35-46"]}
{"unit_id":"XiaoOu2024__dsh-root-planner-preset#feature-4","repo":"XiaoOu2024/dsh-root-planner-preset","commit":"0ea2ff01526c16010c9c694e2e36510626f8ffe5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Root Planner 的功能「深度创造预设」：可选择加入额外的 Cordis 检查工具与开发技能，面向需要开展 Cordis 插件开发的任务；相关预设在 bundle 配置中定义。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:8-21"]}
